WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.597
A counterexample to Lax's conjecture.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.126
Hyperbolicity cones generalize matrix cones. The counterexample

3
00:00:06.126 --> 00:00:09.051
is built from the Choi Lam form.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.135
Any matrix description would yield a square that Choi Lam forbids.

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.266
Claimed: no linear slice of any size.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.079
Lean checks part.
